# FAQ

## 关闭重排效果不理想的元素的方式？

建议使用dis_layout标签，直接关闭该元素重排，如下所示：

![](https://communityfile-drcn.op.dbankcloud.cn/FileServer/getFile/cmtyPub/011/111/111/0000000000011111111.20230912163214.66328874727171527982703599145234:50001231000000:2800:8BA83607D4BB7AF11C9CAE2A1F4BF421FBB1498D7DC2FCD1B51848E56850420D.png?needInitFileName=true?needInitFileName=true)

## 对特定元素使用特定重排规则的方式？

目前支持在class中添加如下标签以对特定元素触发特定的重排规则：

|标签|**含义**|**具体策略**|**示例**|
|:-----------|:-------|:--------------------------------------|:------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|hw_one_row|单行|整行缩放为原来的一半|![](https://communityfile-drcn.op.dbankcloud.cn/FileServer/getFile/cmtyPub/011/111/111/0000000000011111111.20230912163214.92358849941253568195574458939613:50001231000000:2800:362A3EA97D3A09CD77ED2A6A0A53808A73294946E73BEE77E2FBE98B44D1F7B4.jpg?needInitFileName=true?needInitFileName=true "点击放大")|
|hw_list|多行列表 父元素|打标元素为列表元素的父元素，所有子元素缩放为原来的一半，自动换行且左对齐|![](https://communityfile-drcn.op.dbankcloud.cn/FileServer/getFile/cmtyPub/011/111/111/0000000000011111111.20230912163214.35917511531297772507897693956601:50001231000000:2800:044D929445A15DE88540565BC49E9AF99C4F35E4EA417A61897253A4416781EB.jpg?needInitFileName=true?needInitFileName=true "点击放大")|
|hw_list_item|多行列表 子元素|打标元素为列表元素，缩放为原来的一半，自动换行且左对齐|![](https://communityfile-drcn.op.dbankcloud.cn/FileServer/getFile/cmtyPub/011/111/111/0000000000011111111.20230912163215.30065412934358493781609941167012:50001231000000:2800:BC5A5556BD90A35373A7B75099051FE142EF999490AE9BD2B51370614CB56BC0.jpg?needInitFileName=true?needInitFileName=true "点击放大")|
|hw_large_img|大图|缩放为原来的0.75，添加一个高斯模糊的背景|![](https://communityfile-drcn.op.dbankcloud.cn/FileServer/getFile/cmtyPub/011/111/111/0000000000011111111.20230912163215.62679309761649497192732798829730:50001231000000:2800:65965169D02185799877F0BD91DD825D2CBD6D80A9236DCE66F4456F18EA231B.jpg?needInitFileName=true?needInitFileName=true "点击放大")|
|hw_grid_list|宫格列表|整行缩放为原来的0.75，居中|NA|
|hw_waterfall|瀑布流|打标元素为列表元素的父元素，所有子元素缩放为原来的一半，位置按照瀑布流自动排列|![](https://communityfile-drcn.op.dbankcloud.cn/FileServer/getFile/cmtyPub/011/111/111/0000000000011111111.20230912163215.81567017602411254633082617306732:50001231000000:2800:542B88562F3B53BCFFE4710E9B2C27FB994484F7F0E7422F75D62A92EB1D5190.jpg?needInitFileName=true?needInitFileName=true "点击放大")|
|hw_cross|通知栏|拉长并缩放为原来的一半|![](https://communityfile-drcn.op.dbankcloud.cn/FileServer/getFile/cmtyPub/011/111/111/0000000000011111111.20230912163216.67833661995488616217497439158907:50001231000000:2800:C7382548EAFF576C238CAC9A6E43C27094D392B821565DBDC55869AFF7E873C0.jpg?needInitFileName=true?needInitFileName=true "点击放大")|
|dis_layout|关闭重排|禁止对此元素以及此元素的祖先和子孙元素做重排|NA|

